## Cloud Processing

### What Data Goes to Cursor Cloud

When using Cursor's cloud features (cloud agent, cloud automation):

| Data Type | Stored By | Retention | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------|-----------|---------|
| **Cloud VM code** | Cursor cloud | Ephemeral (VM destroyed after run) | Agent execution |
| **Agent runs** | cursor.com | 30 days (configurable) | Session replay, debugging |
| **Transcripts** | cursor.com | 30 days (configurable) | Session review, analytics |
| **API requests** | Provider (Anthropic/OpenAI) | Per provider policy | Code generation |
| **Telemetry** | Cursor | Aggregated, anonymized | Product improvement |

### What Data Goes to Model Providers

| Provider | Data Retention | Policy |
|----------|---------------|--------|
| **Anthropic** | Does not retain training data | Review [Anthropic privacy policy](https://www.anthropic.com/privacy) |
| **OpenAI** | Does not retain training data for paid tiers | Review [OpenAI privacy policy](https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy) |
| **Custom endpoints** | Per your own policy | Your organization's data retention |

### Cloud-Only Operations

These operations require data to leave your machine:

| Operation | Data Sent | Reason |
|-----------|-----------|--------|
| **Cloud Agent runs** | Full repo clone | Agent executes in cloud VM |
| **PR creation (cloud)** | Full diff + context | Agent creates PR on your behalf |
| **Automations (cloud)** | Triggered repo state | Scheduled agent runs |
| **Cursor.com dashboard** | Usage metrics, agent IDs | Analytics and management |

