## Data Retention

### Retention Periods

| Data Type | Retention | Manageable? | Location |
|-----------|-----------|-------------|----------|
| **Agent sessions** | 30 days (configurable) | Yes, via settings | cursor.com |
| **Transcripts** | 30 days (configurable) | Yes, manual delete | cursor.com |
| **Cloud VM data** | Deleted on VM termination | N/A | Cloud VM |
| **Debug logs** | Until manually deleted | Yes, local | Local disk |
| **Tab completion history** | Per session | Yes, cleared on restart | Local |
| **Model provider data** | Per provider policy | No | Provider |

### Managing Retention

```json
{
  // Agent session retention (days)
  "cursor.agent.sessionRetentionDays": 30,
  
  // Transcript retention (days)
  "cursor.agent.transcriptRetentionDays": 30,
  
  // Auto-delete cloud agent data after run
  "cursor.agent.autoDeleteAfterRun": true,
  
  // Disable session recording
  "cursor.agent.sessionRecording": false
}
```

### Deleting Data

```bash
# Clear local agent logs
rm ~/.cursor/Logs/agent.log

# Delete agent session from cloud
# Visit: https://cursor.com/dashboard/sessions

# Clear all cached data
# Settings → Developer → Clear Cache
```

