## Air-Gapped Usage

### Can Cursor Work Without Internet?

| Feature | Works Offline? | Requirements |
|---------|---------------|--------------|
| **Tab Completions** | ✅ Yes (with local model) | Ollama/vLLM installed locally |
| **Ask Mode (local files)** | ❌ No | Requires model API |
| **Agent Mode** | ❌ No | Requires model API |
| **File operations (Read, Write)** | ✅ Yes | No network needed |
| **Shell commands** | ✅ Yes | No network needed |
| **Cloud Agent** | ❌ No | Requires internet |
| **Cursor.com features** | ❌ No | Requires internet |

### Fully Offline Configuration

```json
{
  // Local-only model for everything
  "cursor.agent.chatProvider": "custom",
  "cursor.agent.chatModel": "llama3:8b",
  "cursor.agent.chatBaseUrl": "http://localhost:11434/v1",
  
  "cursor.agent.agentProvider": "custom",
  "cursor.agent.agentModel": "llama3:8b",
  "cursor.agent.agentBaseUrl": "http://localhost:11434/v1",
  
  "cursor.agent.tabProvider": "custom",
  "cursor.agent.tabModel": "llama3:8b",
  "cursor.agent.tabBaseUrl": "http://localhost:11434/v1",
  
  // Disable all cloud features
  "cursor.cloud.enabled": false,
  "cursor.agent.attribution.enabled": false,
  
  // Disable all telemetry
  "telemetry.telemetryLevel": "off",
  "cursor.telemetry.enabled": false
}
```

### Offline Limitations

- No cloud agent runs
- No team workspace sync
- No cursor.com dashboard access
- No automatic model updates
- Manual model management only

