## Model Data Policies

### What Model Providers Do With Your Data

| Provider | Training Data | API Data | Retention |
|----------|-------------|----------|-----------|
| **Anthropic** | Does not retain for training | Processed in memory | Deleted after processing |
| **OpenAI** | Paid tier: No training | Processed in memory | Short-term cache only |
| **OpenAI** | Free tier: May retain | Processed in memory | Per terms of service |
| **Custom endpoints** | Per your policy | Per your policy | Your control |

### Configuring Provider-Specific Privacy

```json
{
  // Anthropic: Enterprise-grade privacy
  "cursor.agent.providerConfig.anthropic": {
    "enterprise": true,
    "dataRetentionDays": 0
  },
  
  // OpenAI: Paid tier recommended for privacy
  "cursor.agent.providerConfig.openai": {
    "tier": "paid",
    "noTrainingData": true
  }
}
```

