## Settings to Control Privacy

### Comprehensive Privacy Settings

| Setting | Purpose | Recommended Value |
|---------|---------|------------------|
| `telemetry.telemetryLevel` | Overall telemetry level | `"minimal"` or `"off"` |
| `cursor.telemetry.enabled` | Enable/disable all telemetry | `false` for full privacy |
| `cursor.agent.sessionRecording` | Record agent sessions | `false` if not needed |
| `cursor.cloud.enabled` | Enable cloud features | `false` for air-gapped |
| `cursor.agent.contextWindow` | Context size (larger = more data sent) | Minimum needed |
| `cursor.agent.autoDeleteAfterRun` | Delete cloud data after run | `true` |

```json
{
  // Maximum privacy configuration
  "telemetry.telemetryLevel": "off",
  "cursor.telemetry.enabled": false,
  "cursor.agent.sessionRecording": false,
  "cursor.cloud.enabled": true,
  "cursor.agent.autoDeleteAfterRun": true,
  "cursor.agent.transcriptRetentionDays": 7
}
```

### Sensitive File Exclusions

```json
{
  // Prevent agent from reading sensitive files
  "files.exclude": {
    "**/.env": true,
    "**/.env.local": true,
    "**/secrets/*": true,
    "**/*.pem": true,
    "**/private/": true
  }
}
```

